    id: "ki-sm-bike-weapon-type-not-granted-01",
    status: "fixed",
    title: "Space Marines — 'Space Marine bike' (and 2 related mount items) added its stat bonuses but not its weapon/unit type",
    description: "FIXED 2026-09-03, reported via the in-app bug form (GitHub #112: \"adding a space marine bike (equipment) does not add the ranged weapon built into the bike... i expected an extra ranged attack to show up\"). Confirmed against the canonical .ods (Space Marines 1.01, Armory sheet — production text was already verbatim-correct) before touching anything. CAUSE: the item's description grants several things in one sentence — \"...a Twin bolt rifle, the 'Bike' type, and 'Devastating Charge'...\" — a shape the engine's plain-text weapon-grant parser (`isGrantWeapon`/`extractGrantedWeaponName` in equipMods.ts) doesn't match: it only recognizes \"the model gains a X\" where X ends in a handful of suffix words (gun/cannon/missile/weapon), and \"a Twin bolt rifle\" isn't phrased that way. Separately, \"Twin bolt rifle\" (a 3-ammo-mode weapon used by Outrider Squads/Invader-Quad) had never been added to the Space Marines general Armory's own weapon list, so even a matching parse would have found nothing to grant. The unit-type change (\"Bike\") had the identical root cause — no `effect.adds_unit_types` existed on the item at all. FIX: added the 3 Twin bolt rifle ammo profiles (Bolt/Stalker/Assault) to `data/parsed/space_marines/armory/general.json`'s weapon list (not independently purchasable — granted-only, matching the existing \"Ossific Blades\" convention), and gave \"Space Marine bike\" a structured `effect: {grants_weapons, adds_unit_types: [\"Bike\"]}` — the same mechanism already used by dozens of other Armory items for this exact shape, so no new engine capability was needed, only the missing data. (Rigzar then asked whether other factions could have the same gap — they did; see ki-crossfaction-bike-mount-effect-audit-01 for the 8-item, 6-faction follow-up audit this prompted.) Verified live: a Scout Squad with Space Marine bike bought shows \"INFANTRY, BIKE\" as its type, 12\" Movement (was 6\"), T5 (was 4), and all 3 Twin bolt rifle ammo profiles now listed under Ranged Weapons at the squad's full model count; the Abilities count went from (4) to (5) — exactly \"Devastating Charge\" added once, with no duplicate \"Bike\" ability line.",
